WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.641 --> 00:00:06.070
No reviews, no sites connected, nothing to summarise.

2
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:11.402
So it says why it matters, with a number you can cite.

3
00:00:11.402 --> 00:00:14.621
And one thing to do today: a code for the till.

4
00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:25.243
A week in. Four reviews, and a chart that will not lie about them.

5
00:00:25.243 --> 00:00:35.101
Too few for a trend, so it lists them instead.

6
00:00:40.543 --> 00:00:50.682
Eight months in, and now the six months mean something.

7
00:00:53.089 --> 00:00:58.138
Make reviews a habit, not a project.
